mw2coop patch for maps/invasion.gsc (Wolverines!, Modern Warfare 2, 64-bit Steam build)

1. Mission end: player 1 walks to the convoy Humvee and is seated on tag_guy1; seat player 2
   on another free seat of the same Humvee.
@@@ replace
	level.player PlayerLinkTo( org, "tag_origin", 0.8, 180, 180, 40, 40 );
@@@ with
	level.player PlayerLinkTo( org, "tag_origin", 0.8, 180, 180, 40, 40 );
	if ( maps\_mw2coop::is_campaign_coop() )
		humvee maps\_mw2coop::seat_partner_in_vehicle( level.player2, 180, 180, 40, 40, "tag_guy1" );
@@@ end

2. Opening ride: all seats of the player's Humvee hold AI, so Worm, a squadmate the mission
   lets die later, gives up his rear seat when player 2 is seated
   (maps\_mw2coop::seat_partner_in_vehicle); the opening's three uses of level.worm that do
   not check he is alive get that check.
@@@ replace
	level.humvee_player = spawn_vehicle_from_targetname_and_drive( "humvee_player" );
	level.humvee_player playsound( "scn_invasion_humvee_ridein" );
@@@ with
	level.humvee_player = spawn_vehicle_from_targetname_and_drive( "humvee_player" );
	level.humvee_player playsound( "scn_invasion_humvee_ridein" );
	level.mw2coop_spare_rider = "worm";
@@@ end
@@@ replace
	level.taco pushplayer( true );
	level.worm pushplayer( true );
	level.worm thread magic_bullet_shield();
@@@ with
	level.taco pushplayer( true );
	if ( isalive( level.worm ) )
	{
		level.worm pushplayer( true );
		level.worm thread magic_bullet_shield();
	}
@@@ end
@@@ replace
	level.worm pushplayer( true );
	
	org player_leaves_humvee();
	
	thread dialog_go_to_yards();
	
	wait 1;
	setSavedDvar( "hud_drawhud", "1" );
	
	level.raptor pushplayer( true );
	level.taco pushplayer( true );
	level.worm pushplayer( true );
@@@ with
	if ( isalive( level.worm ) )
		level.worm pushplayer( true );
	
	org player_leaves_humvee();
	
	thread dialog_go_to_yards();
	
	wait 1;
	setSavedDvar( "hud_drawhud", "1" );
	
	level.raptor pushplayer( true );
	level.taco pushplayer( true );
	if ( isalive( level.worm ) )
		level.worm pushplayer( true );
@@@ end

3. Enemies sent at "the player" (the diner's back door, Burger Town's defenders) go for the
   closest player still up (maps\_mw2coop::seek_player; player 1 outside co-op).
@@@ subst setup_diner_backdoor_attackers
self.favoriteenemy = level.player
@@@ to
self.favoriteenemy = maps\_mw2coop::seek_player( self.origin )
@@@ end
@@@ subst setup_diner_backdoor_attackers
self setgoalentity( level.player )
@@@ to
self setgoalentity( maps\_mw2coop::seek_player( self.origin ) )
@@@ end
@@@ subst setup_BT_enemy_defenders
self setgoalentity( level.player )
@@@ to
self setgoalentity( maps\_mw2coop::seek_player( self.origin ) )
@@@ end

4. The kitchen ladders (Nate's diner, Burger Town) are blocked behind the player who has gone up
   (the clip turns solid once "player_on_roof" / "player_on_burgertown_roof" is set and level.player
   is not in it): player 2, still below, could start climbing and hit the clip at the top. In
   co-op the ladders stay open.
@@@ subst setup_nates_kitchen_ladder_clip
nates_kitchen_ladder_clip solid();
@@@ to
if ( !maps\_mw2coop::is_campaign_coop() )
			nates_kitchen_ladder_clip solid();
@@@ end
@@@ subst setup_bt_ktichen_ladder_clip
bt_ktichen_ladder_clip solid();
@@@ to
if ( !maps\_mw2coop::is_campaign_coop() )
			bt_ktichen_ladder_clip solid();
@@@ end

5. The Predator laptop (remote_missile_detonator): the level gives it to level.player together with
   the d-pad slot and the threads that raise the laptop, run the drone and put it away
   (maps\_remotemissile::give_remotemissile_weapon). Player 2 only got a copy of the weapon from
   the loadout sync, with none of that: with the laptop out he could neither use nor put it away.
@@@ subst give_player_predator_drone
level.player maps\_remotemissile::give_remotemissile_weapon( "remote_missile_detonator" );
@@@ to
level.player maps\_remotemissile::give_remotemissile_weapon( "remote_missile_detonator" );
	if ( maps\_mw2coop::is_campaign_coop() && isdefined( level.player2 ) )
		level.player2 maps\_remotemissile::give_remotemissile_weapon( "remote_missile_detonator" );
@@@ end

6. The allies' catch-up sprint (friendly_adjust_movement_speed: moveplaybackrate 2.5 while friendly_should_speed_up()) runs only when the host cannot see the ally. With the host
   ahead and the client trailing, the allies sprinted past the client's eyes (an owner's report: "the slingshot"). Now every player has to be unable to see them.
@@@ subst friendly_should_speed_up
within_fov( level.player.origin, level.player getPlayerAngles(), self.origin, level.cosine[ "60" ] )
@@@ to
maps\_mw2coop::any_player_sees( self, level.cosine[ "60" ] )
@@@ end

7. The smoke on the BMP that rolls up to Nate's (the "house destroyer", night audit 2026-11-17): the level waited for player 1's smoke
   grenade only (wait_till_btr_smoked, watch_for_smoke_throws), so player 2's smoke on the BMP did nothing and the section waited for
   player 1. Either player's throw counts now (maps\_mw2coop::any_player_grenade_fire); the nag asks for a throw while either player
   has a smoke grenade, and the "get smoke" hint goes away by the smoke of the player who sees it.
@@@ subst wait_till_btr_smoked
level.player waittill ( "grenade_fire", grenade, weaponName );
@@@ to
mw2coop_throw = maps\_mw2coop::any_player_grenade_fire();
		grenade = mw2coop_throw.grenade;
		weaponName = mw2coop_throw.weapon;
@@@ end
@@@ subst watch_for_smoke_throws
level.player waittill ( "grenade_fire", grenade, weaponName );
@@@ to
mw2coop_throw = maps\_mw2coop::any_player_grenade_fire();
		grenade = mw2coop_throw.grenade;
		weaponName = mw2coop_throw.weapon;
@@@ end
@@@ subst dialog_semtex_that_bmp
player_has_semtex = level.player GetWeaponAmmoStock( "smoke_grenade_american" );
@@@ to
player_has_semtex = maps\_mw2coop::players_ammo_stock( "smoke_grenade_american" );
@@@ end
@@@ subst should_break_get_smoke
level.player
@@@ to
self
@@@ end

